  "description": "The Nua Kensho Pinion Smart.Shift is the most advanced evolution of the Kensho platform, combining titanium craftsmanship with electronically controlled gearbox shifting for an effortlessly modern commuting experience. Designed for riders who value precision, convenience, and cutting-edge technology, it brings together mechanical reliability and digital refinement in a single, elegant package. The frame is constructed from Grade 9 titanium, delivering the signature Kensho ride feel: smooth, resilient, and responsive. Titanium’s natural vibration damping reduces road fatigue, while the dropped seatstays enhance comfort by filtering surface imperfections without dulling the bike’s lively character. It’s a frame built for daily use, all-season riding, and decades of performance. At the core of this model is the Pinion Smart.Shift gearbox system. By combining a sealed, centrally mounted gearbox with electronic actuation, Smart.Shift delivers fast, consistent, and effortless gear changes at the press of a button. Shifting is precise in all conditions, including under load or at a standstill, and the system maintains the same exceptional durability and low maintenance that define Pinion gearboxes—now enhanced with intuitive electronic control. The front end features the Nua Commuter carbon fork with a tapered 1.5″ steerer, providing sharp steering accuracy, confident braking, and stability in demanding urban scenarios. Carbon construction reduces weight and absorbs high-frequency vibrations, contributing to a calm and controlled ride through traffic and over rough pavement. Rolling on Campagnolo Zonda GT wheels, the Kensho Pinion Smart.Shift offers dependable performance across city streets and mixed terrain. The wheelset balances strength, efficiency, and smooth handling, reinforcing the bike’s premium, performance-oriented feel. Available as a frameset or complete bicycle, the Nua Kensho Pinion Smart.Shift is built to order for riders seeking the most advanced commuter solution—clean, quiet, technologically refined, and designed to elevate everyday riding.",
